OL,3,AWhatsApp chat used to send cash for
OL,4,Acrime and extremism
OL,5,
OL,6,FA WhatsApp group chat was used to send
OL,7,Fhundreds of millions of euros in cash
OL,8,Faround the world, funding organised
OL,9,Fcrime and extremism with no paper
OL,10,Ftrail, an investigation by European
OL,11,Fbroadcasters has found.
OL,13,FThe 532-member group chat, called
OL,14,F"Traders of Greater Europe", was used
OL,15,Fto arrange cash transfers across
OL,16,Fborders for their clients, including to
OL,17,FBritish cities such as Birmingham and
OL,18,FLondon.
OL,20,FIn one case, payments from Brussels
OL,21,Fwent to militants from the Islamic
OL,22,FState group (IS) in Syria.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
